  "question": {
    "text": "A coil of cross-sectional area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> having&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> turns is placed in a uniform magnetic field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. When it is rotated with an angular velocity <math><mi>&#969;,</mi></math> the maximum e.m.f. induced in the coil will be:",
